WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.001 --> 00:00:03.966
Rat and Mole were lost in the forest.

2
00:00:03.967 --> 00:00:07.682
It was cold, but they tried to be cheerful.

3
00:00:07.683 --> 00:00:13.229
"I've seen that tree over there before," said Rat.

4
00:00:13.230 --> 00:00:15.262
Then he shook his head.

5
00:00:15.263 --> 00:00:19.628
"No, I guess not."

6
00:00:19.629 --> 00:00:23.531
"That round rock looks familiar," said Mole.

7
00:00:23.532 --> 00:00:26.080
"Good for you, Mole," said Rat.

8
00:00:26.081 --> 00:00:29.475
They walked over to a big rock.

9
00:00:29.476 --> 00:00:34.812
"It's not the one I thought," sighed Mole.

10
00:00:34.813 --> 00:00:39.362
"We'll find the way," said Rat. "Don't worry."

11
00:00:39.363 --> 00:00:43.644
But Rat knew they were in trouble.

12
00:00:43.645 --> 00:00:49.914
All they could see was white snow and black trees.

13
00:00:49.915 --> 00:00:56.066
They kept walking for hours.

14
00:00:56.067 --> 00:00:58.899
"Let's rest a minute," said Rat.

15
00:00:58.900 --> 00:01:02.359
Rat sat down on a fallen tree.

16
00:01:02.360 --> 00:01:09.332
They were tired, hungry, and very cold.

17
00:01:09.333 --> 00:01:12.912
"We can't stay here long," said Mole.

18
00:01:12.913 --> 00:01:15.426
"The snow will get too deep."

19
00:01:15.427 --> 00:01:19.574
Mole held out his hand for his friend.

20
00:01:19.575 --> 00:01:21.310
Rat took it.

21
00:01:21.311 --> 00:01:25.287
"Thank you," he said, and stood.

22
00:01:25.288 --> 00:01:27.643
They walked a little further.

23
00:01:27.644 --> 00:01:30.033
"Look, Mole," said Rat.

24
00:01:30.034 --> 00:01:33.254
"There's a small valley ahead of us.

25
00:01:33.255 --> 00:01:38.525
Maybe it has a dry place where we can rest."

26
00:01:38.526 --> 00:01:41.655
"That's a good idea," said Mole.

27
00:01:41.656 --> 00:01:46.854
The wind blew hard and the snow fell thick.

28
00:01:46.855 --> 00:01:50.098
The two friends went into the valley.

29
00:01:50.099 --> 00:01:56.221
They searched for a dry hole or an empty cave.

30
00:01:56.222 --> 00:01:59.470
Suddenly Mole tripped and fell.

31
00:01:59.471 --> 00:02:03.925
"Ow! My leg!" he cried.

32
00:02:03.926 --> 00:02:07.276
He held his leg in his paws.

33
00:02:07.277 --> 00:02:10.944
It was bleeding.

